# Copy this file to .env.local for local development.
# .env.local is git-ignored and must never be committed.

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# FRONTEND (VITE_*) — bundled into the browser JS at build time
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# LOCAL DEV ONLY — direct Anthropic calls from the browser (no backend needed).
# How: set this in .env.local, run `npm run dev`, attach a receipt → OCR fires.
# When set, the frontend bypasses /api/ocr and calls Anthropic directly.
#
# ⚠  NEVER set VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in Vercel Dashboard env vars.
#    It would be embedded in the public JS bundle and expose your key to anyone.
#    For production, use ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (server-side only, see below).
#
# VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# BACKEND (server-side only) — never reaches the browser
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Production & Preview: add this in Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables
#   Name:  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#   Value: sk-ant-...
#   Scope: Production, Preview  (NOT Development unless you use `vercel dev`)
#
# Local dev with vercel CLI: add to .env.local, run `vercel dev` (not npm run dev).
#   The /api/ocr Edge Function will pick it up automatically.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# QUICK REFERENCE
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Scenario                        | Variable                | Where
# --------------------------------|-------------------------|---------------------------
# Local dev, no Vercel CLI        | VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY  | .env.local (dev only)
# Local dev with `vercel dev`     | ANTHROPIC_API_KEY       | .env.local
# Production / Preview on Vercel  | ANTHROPIC_API_KEY       | Vercel Dashboard (server)
